## Delivery Tips — General

| Do | Don't |
|:---|:---|
| Pause between sections — let them ask questions | Monologue for 5+ minutes without stopping |
| Say "I" not "we" when describing your decisions | Hide behind team language |
| Mention what you rejected and why | Make it sound like every decision was obvious |
| Use exact numbers casually | Say "massive scale" or "huge volumes" |
| Offer to draw on a whiteboard | Just talk into the air |
| Admit tradeoffs and limitations | Pretend everything was perfect |
| Ask "Shall I go deeper on that?" after key points | Assume they want the maximum detail |
| End answers with a clear conclusion | Trail off without landing the point |

